    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MEG: They’re waiting for you.\nLIZ: What happened yesterday?",
      "MEG: After we land tomorrow morning, we can surprise her at the jazz festival.\nLIZ: What do you mean, they’re giving the tribute to someone else?",
      "LIZ: Well, it should be the greeter.\nKRISTA: Remember the last time we were in Paris? The Chanel show? It was in silence out of respect for the war.\nCANDY: I remember Gucci. That was very loud. Maybe it was for peace.",
      "MEG: Flag on the play! We’re catching a train to Italy!\nLIZ: A train? We’re literally standing next to a plane.\nKRISTA: Why did we fly to Paris then?",
      "LIZ: That’s the problem, I’m not allowed to be mad at you.\nMEG: According to Claire, Rio got a chai latte at the Starbucks at Gare de Lyon forty-five minutes ago."
    ]
  },
